iage: eligible. 8 testable ACs covering inactivity threshold, fallback, AND logic, input validation, defaults, ISO rejection, corrupt events, and liveness guard.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJK0T1ZVRG2WT45A2FFDBM7D\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-28T20:59:57.819Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"Execution context:\\n- Background: implement stale-session candidate selection for upcoming auto-close flow.\\n- Scope: add criteria parsing/validation and candidate selection logic, with fallback + guard behavior per @session-stale-criteria ACs.\\n- Files: primarily ralph/session command implementation + session store helpers + tests for candidate selection and CLI validation paths.\\n- Verification: targeted stale-session tests plus full npm test and kspec validate before submit.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJK19NHPSA4DF6RE7TK8A6QQ\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-28T21:08:29.367Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"Implemented stale-session criteria engine in src/sessions/store.ts: relative-duration validation/defaults (older-than=24h, inactive-for=6h, liveness-guard=5m), strict activity resolution with started_at fallback for missing events, AND-based threshold evaluation, and liveness-guard suppression for recently-active sessions. Added AC-annotated regression coverage in tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts for @session-stale-criteria ac-1..ac-8, including corrupt events handling and absolute timestamp rejection guidance. Verification: npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/sessions.test.ts; npm test (full suite pass: 3578 passed, 3 skipped). kspec validate currently reports known pre-existing repo-level schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJK1FDV5F4QR90BBFNCFQHFJ\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-28T21:11:38.085Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"Automation status set to needs_review: Subagent completed but did not merge or kick back. Review required.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJK1FGDP1PSMC4ND2M4VC4NW\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-28T21:11:40.727Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"[RALPH SUBAGENT] Subagent completed but did not merge or kick back. Review required.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJK2B9XM881XGMFXE5DKF1HR\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-28T21:26:51.572Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: MUST-FIX: AC-7 coverage is incomplete in PR #605. tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts covers corrupt events.jsonl but not unreadable events.jsonl failure path; add explicit unreadable-case test asserting skipped/failure counts and warning context.\",\n      \"supersedes\": null,\n      \"superseded\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"_ulid\": \"01KJK2REWT51YVGY85GJ5AMF25\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-28T21:34:02.650Z\",\n      \"author\": \"@claude\",\n      \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Addressed MUST-FIX for @session-stale-criteria ac-7 by adding explicit unreadable events.jsonl coverage in tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts. New AC-annotated test creates an unreadable events path and asserts skipped/failure totals plus warning context (reason=events_unreadable, detail includes read failure context). Commit b563c372 pushed to PR #605 branch (feat/session-stale-candidate-criteria). Verification: npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts passes (12 tests). Full npm test run in this session still reports pre-existing timeout failures in tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts and tests/cli/session-start-format.test.ts unrelated to stal